### Pulse — Foundation acceptance tests (Phase B1)
### Run with VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health check — must return 200 { status: "ok" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Sign up as new donor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DONOR",
  "name": "Foundation Test Donor",
  "email": "foundation.donor@test.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "phone": "9000099999",
  "blood_type": "B+",
  "city": "Pune",
  "latitude": 18.5204,
  "longitude": 73.8567
}

###

### Sign up as new staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "STAFF",
  "name": "Foundation Test Staff",
  "email": "foundation.staff@test.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "staff_role": "Tester"
}

###

### Login as seeded staff (City Care)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "STAFF",
  "email": "staff.citycare@example.com",
  "password": "Pulse@123"
}

###

### Login as seeded donor (Aarav — password Pulse@123)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DONOR",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "Pulse@123"
}

###

### Login as admin (npm run seed:admin must have been run)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "email": "admin@pulse.test",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### T6 — Wrong password → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DONOR",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "WRONG"
}

###

### T7 — No token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###

### T5 — Duplicate email → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "DONOR",
  "name": "Duplicate",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "phone": "9000000000",
  "blood_type": "O+"
}
